name=Tien's Bag Upgrades
id=TienBagUpgrades
description=Sew capacity upgrades and weight-reduction straps onto your bags. A derivative of Dynamic Backpack Upgrades by Dr. Lalaoz, Harrod200 and Lenniitsch (https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2996978365): its idea, items, recipes, settings and loot tables, with new code, models and art. It replaces that mod in existing saves: same items, same sandbox settings, bags you already upgraded keep their upgrades. Bag stats are set once by the server and saved with the bag, so nothing re-checks your inventory while you play and stats never revert.
